[770.579597, "o", "[SEARCH] 搜索结果: 共找到 4 处匹配，分布在 1 个文件中\r\n================================================================================\r\n\\n[FILE] test_build.py (4 处匹配)\\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n    [上下文]\\n      90 |                     assert stat.S_IMODE(member.mode) in (0o644, 0o755)\\n      91 | \r\n>>>   92 |             for name in ['src/src/unix.py', 'src/src/windows.py', 'src/src/file with spaces.txt', 'src/docs/README.txt']:\r\n      93 |                 data = tf.extractfile(name).read()\\n      94 |                 assert b'\\r' not in data\r\n    [上下文]\\n      95 | \\n      96 |             # Binary/mixed content should remain unchanged and not be forced to LF-only.\r\n>>>   97 |             mixed = tf.extractfile('src/src/mixed.dat').read()"]
